        {
          "line_num": 1,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ፍትሑ ፡ እስኩ ፡ ለሊክሙ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 2,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ይህንን ፡ ነገር ፡ እስኪ ፡ እናንት ፡ ፍረዱት ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 3,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ም ፡ ፭ ፥ ፳፱ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 4,
          "margin_tag": "፳",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪፳ ፤ ንሕነሰኬ ፡ ኢንክል ፡ ከቢቶቶ ፡ ለዝንቱ ፡ ነገር ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 5,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "እኛስ ፡ ይህን ፡ ነገር ፡ ሠውረን ፡ ልናስቀ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 6,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ረው ፡ አይቻለንም ፡ ብለው ፡ መለሱላቸው ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 7,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወእምዝ ፡ ገሠጽዎሙ ፡ ወኀደግዎሙ ፡ ሶበ ፡ ኃጥኡ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 8,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "በዘይኴንንዎሙ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 9,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ከዚህ ፡ በኋላ ፡ ይሞት ፡ በቃ ፡ በሚፈር",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 10,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ዱባቸው ፡ ገንዘብ ፡ የሚፈርዱበት ፡ ምክ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 11,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ንያት ፡ ባያገኙ ፡ ሸመጣጠው ፡ ተዋቸው ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 12,
          "margin_tag": "፳፩",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪፳፩ ፤ እስመ ፡ ኵሉ ፡ ሕዝብ ፡ የአኵቱ ፡ እግዚአብ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 13,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሔርሃ ፡ በእንተ ፡ ውእቱ ፡ ተአምር ፡ ዘኮነ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 14,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ስለ ፡ ተደረገው ፡ ነገር ፡ ሕዝቡ ፡ ሁሉ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 15,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "እግዚአብሔርን ፡ ያመሰግኑ ፡ ነበርና ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 16,
          "margin_tag": "፳፪",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪፳፪ ፤ እስመ ፡ ፈድፋደ ፡ እምአርብዓ ፡ ዓመት ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 17,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ለውእቱ ፡ ብእሲ ፡ ዘበላዕሌሁ ፡ ኮነ ፡ ዝ ፡ ተአምረ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 18,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሕይወት ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 19,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ይህ ፡ የድኅነት ፡ ምልክት ፡ የተደረገለት ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 20,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሰው ፡ ከታመመ ፡ ካርባ ፡ ዘመን ፡ በል",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 21,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ጦት ፡ ስለ ፡ ነበረ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 22,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወተፈቲሖሙ ፡ ሖሩ ፡ ኀበ ፡ ሰብኦሙ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 23,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ከሥራታቸው ፡ ተፈተው ፡ ተፋቲሆሙ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 24,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ይላል ፡ ከነሱ ፡ ተሰናብተው ፡ ወደ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 25,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ወገኖቻቸው ፡ ሄዱ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 26,
          "margin_tag": "፳፫",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪፳፫ ፤ ወነገርዎሙ ፡ ኵሎ ፡ ዘይቤልዎሙ ፡ ሊቃነ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 27,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ካህናት ፡ ወረበናት ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 28,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ተመልሰው ፡ የካህናቱ ፡ አለቆች ፡ ረበ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 29,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ናት ፡ ያሏቸውን ፡ ሁሉ ፡ ነገሯቸው ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 30,
          "margin_tag": "፳፬",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪፳፬ ፤ ወሰሚዖሙ ፡ አንሥኡ ፡ ቃሎሙ ፡ ኅቡረ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 31,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ኀበ ፡ እግዚአብሔር ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 32,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ይህን ፡ በሰሙ ፡ ጊዜ ፡ ሁሉም ፡ አንድ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 33,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሁነው ፡ ወደ ፡ እግዚአብሔር ፡ ጸሎት ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 34,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ጸለዩ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "column_index": 2,
      "lines": [
        {
          "line_num": 1,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወይቤሉ ፡ አንተ ፡ እግዚአብሔር ፡ አምላክ ፡ ዘገበ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 2,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ርከ ፡ ሰማየ ፡ ወምድረ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 3,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሰማይ ፡ ምድሩን ፡ የፈጠርህ ፡ አምላክ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 4,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "አንተ ፡ ነህ ፡ የፈጠርህ ፡ አቤቱ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 5,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወባሕረ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 6,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ባሕሩን ፡ የፈጠርህ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 7,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወኵሎ ፡ ዘውስቴቶሙ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 8,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "በውስጣቸው ፡ ያሉትንም ፡ የፈጠርህ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 9,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "አለ ፡ በሰማይ ፡ ያሉ ፡ ፀሐይ ፡ ጨረቃን ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 10,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ከዋክብትን ፡ መላእክትን ፡ በምድር ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 11,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ያሉ ፡ ደቂቀ ፡ አዳምን ፡ እንስሳትን ፡ አራ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 12,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ዊትን ፡ አእዋፍን ፡ ዕፀው ፡ አፅባንን ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 13,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "በባሕር ፡ ያሉ ፡ ዓሣ ፡ አንበሪ ፡ አዞ ፡ ጉማ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 14,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሬን ፡ የፈጠርህ ፡ አንተ ፡ ነህ ፡ የፈጠርህ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 15,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "አቤቱ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 16,
          "margin_tag": "፳፭",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪፳፭ ፤ ዘለሊከ ፡ ነበብከ ፡ በመንፈስ ፡ ቅዱስ ፡ በአፈ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 17,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ዳዊት ፡ ገብርከ ፡ አቡነ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 18,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "በመንፈስ ፡ ቅዱስ ፡ ሕልው ፡ ሁነህ ፡ በባ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 19,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ለሟልህ ፡ በዳዊት ፡ አድረህ ፡ የተናገርህ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 20,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "አንተ ፡ ነህ ፡ የተናገርህ ፡ አቤቱ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 21,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወትቤ ፡ ለምንት ፡ አንገለጉ ፡ አሕዛብ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 22,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "አራቱ ፡ ቤት ፡ ጭፍራ ፡ ሮማውያን ፡ ለም",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 23,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ን ፡ ተሰበሰቡ ፡ ለምን ፡ ዶለቱ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 24,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወሕዝብኒ ፡ ነበቡ ፡ ከንቶ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 25,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "እሊያስ ፡ የተነገረውን ፡ ትንቢት ፡ የተቈ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 26,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ጠረውን ፡ ሱባኤ ፡ ባያውቁ ፡ ነው ፡ የተነ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 27,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ገረውን ፡ ትንቢት ፡ የተቈጠረውን ፡ ሱባ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 28,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ኤ ፡ የሚያውቁት ፡ ከንቱ ፡ ነገርን ፡ ለምን ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 29,
